{"t":"TFC","made":"2026-11-20 01:31","name":"Truist Financial Corporation","ko":null,"sector":"Financial Services","industry":"Banks - Regional","employees":37833,"hq":"Charlotte, NC, United States","website":"https://www.truist.com","summary_en":"Truist Financial Corporation, a financial services company, provides banking and trust services in the Southeastern and Mid-Atlantic United States. The company operates through two segments, Consumer and Small Business Banking; and Wholesale Banking. Its deposit products include noninterest-bearing checking, interest-bearing checking, savings, and money market deposit accounts, as well as certificates of deposit and individual retirement accounts. The company also provides funding; asset management; credit card lending; home equity and mortgage lending; other direct retail lending; home mortgage lending; Investment brokerage services; mobile/online banking; payment solutions; point-of-sale lending; retail and small business deposit products; and small business lending. In addition, it offers asset-based lending, commercial deposit and treasury services; commercial lending; floor plan lending; derivatives; institutional trust services; insurance premium finance; international banking; investment banking and capital markets services; leasing; merchant services; mortgage warehouse lending; real estate lending; supply chain financing; and wealth management/private banking. The company was formerly known as BB&T Corporation and changed its name to Truist Financial Corporation in December 2019. Truist Financial Corporation was founded in 1872 and is headquartered in Charlotte, North Carolina.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"금융 서비스 회사인 Truist Financial Corporation은 미국 남동부 및 중부 대서양 지역에서 은행 업무 및 신탁 서비스를 제공합니다. 이 회사는 소비자 금융과 중소기업 금융이라는 두 부문을 통해 운영됩니다. 도매 금융. 예금 상품에는 무이자 수표, 이자 수표, 저축, 머니마켓 예금 계좌, 예금 증서 및 개인 퇴직 계좌가 포함됩니다. 회사는 또한 자금을 제공합니다. 자산 관리; 신용카드 대출; 주택 담보 및 모기지 대출; 기타 직접 소매 대출; 주택담보대출; 투자 중개 서비스; 모바일/온라인 뱅킹; 결제 솔루션; POS 대출; 소매 및 중소기업 예금 상품; 그리고 중소기업 대출. 또한 자산 기반 대출, 상업 예금 및 재무 서비스를 제공합니다. 상업 대출; 평면도 대출; 파생상품; 기관신탁서비스; 보험료 금융; 국제 금융; 투자 은행 및 자본 시장 서비스; 임대; 상인 서비스; 모기지 창고 대출; 부동산 대출; 공급망 파이낸싱; 및 자산 관리/프라이빗 뱅킹. 이 회사는 이전에 BB&T Corporation으로 알려졌으며 2019년 12월에 Truist Financial Corporation으로 이름을 변경했습니다. Truist Financial Corporation은 1872년에 설립되었으며 노스캐롤라이나주 샬럿에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":46.965,"mcap":56287010816.0,"pe":12.104382,"fpe":9.603391,"peg":1.3788,"ps":3.0796638,"pb":1.0040405,"ev_ebitda":null,"div":4.36,"beta":0.871,"hi52":56.2,"lo52":43.13},"fin":{"rev":18276999168.0,"rev_g":-0.158,"eps_g":-0.462,"gross":0.0,"op":0.35126,"net":0.2838,"roe":0.08161,"fcf":null,"cash":56547999744.0,"debt":70286000128.0,"de":null,"eps":3.88,"feps":4.89046},"own":{"short":0.0239,"inst":0.79050004,"insider":0.00183},"analyst":{"n":19,"mean":53.29737,"median":54.0,"high":58.0,"low":45.0,"rec":"hold","recMean":2.63636,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":2,"buy":5,"hold":12,"sell":1,"strongSell":2},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":2,"buy":5,"hold":12,"sell":1,"strongSell":2},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":2,"buy":5,"hold":11,"sell":1,"strongSell":2},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":1,"buy":5,"hold":12,"sell":1,"strongSell":2}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-10-30","Firm":"JP Morgan","ToGrade":"Underweight","FromGrade":"Underweight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":51.5,"priorPriceTarget":50.5},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-21","Firm":"Citigroup","ToGrade":"Neutral","FromGrade":"Neutral","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":50.0,"priorPriceTarget":54.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-20","Firm":"Stephens & Co.","ToGrade":"Overweight","FromGrade":"Overweight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":54.0,"priorPriceTarget":55.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-19","Firm":"RBC Capital","ToGrade":"Outperform","FromGrade":"Outperform","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":51.0,"priorPriceTarget":5